      "id": 237287,
      "name": "Chris Fougere",
      "username": "fougerec",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-05-05T18:42:06.021Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unless there’s an Ability or something we tend to make this an RP thing.  Being the focus of a bunch of minions is generally a really good way to eat a bunch of damage.  Minions in this game are no joke.  When four relatively minor d6 minions chip away 14 health (on average) that’s a big thing.</p>",
